{"step_index":1423,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T20:15:44Z","content":"Agora a parte mais importante — reescrever o `RegisterGlobalHotkeys` e os helpers para usar `Dispatcher.BeginInvoke` (não bloqueante):","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Rewrite RegisterGlobalHotkeys to use BeginInvoke (non-blocking) and pure WPF Window.Opacity for transparency. The hook fires from ThreadPool, so BeginInvoke posts to the UI thread without blocking.","EndLine":279,"Instruction":"Rewrite RegisterGlobalHotkeys with BeginInvoke and pure WPF Opacity","ReplacementContent":"        private void RegisterGlobalHotkeys()\n        {\n            void Reg(Keys k, Action uiAction)\n            {\n                // The action will be invoked from ThreadPool by HotkeyManager.\n                // We use BeginInvoke to post to the UI thread without blocking.\n                _hotkeyManager.Register(NativeMethods.MOD_ALT, k, () =>\n                {\n                    Dispatcher.BeginInvoke(uiAction);\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Alt+Z: Toggle Visibility\n            Reg(Keys.Z, () => _windowManager.ToggleVisibility());\n\n            // Alt+X: Toggle Ghost Mode\n            Reg(Keys.X, () =>\n            {\n                _windowManager.ToggleGhostMode();\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"ghost_mode_toggled\", new { is_ghost = _windowManager.IsGhostMode });\n            });\n\n            // Alt+1/2/3: Transparency Presets\n            Reg(Keys.D1, () => ApplyOpacity(0.40));\n            Reg(Keys.D2, () => ApplyOpacity(0.70));\n            Reg(Keys.D3, () => ApplyOpacity(1.00));\n            Reg(Keys.NumPad1, () => ApplyOpacity(0.40));\n            Reg(Keys.NumPad2, () => ApplyOpacity(0.70));\n            Reg(Keys.NumPad3, () => ApplyOpacity(1.00));\n\n            // Alt+[ / Alt+]: Step transparency down/up\n            Reg(Keys.OemOpenBrackets, () => ApplyOpacity(this.Opacity - 0.15));\n            Reg(Keys.OemCloseBrackets, () => ApplyOpacity(this.Opacity + 0.15));\n            Reg(Keys.Oem4, () => ApplyOpacity(this.Opacity - 0.15));\n            Reg(Keys.Oem6, () => ApplyOpacity(this.Opacity + 0.15));\n\n            // Alt+Q/W/E: AI Presets\n            Reg(Keys.Q, () =>\n            {\n                _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"primary\";\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"primary\" });\n            });\n            Reg(Keys.W, () =>\n            {\n                _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"secondary\";\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"secondary\" });\n            });\n            Reg(Keys.E, () =>\n            {\n                _sessionController.Llm.ActivePreset = \"auto\";\n                SendJsonToWeb(\"preset_switched\", new { preset = \"